[I] NetSurf utf-8 library

[T] libutf8proc is the utf8proc Unicode library repackaged as a convenience
[T] library for NetSurf with its build system and a pkg-config file, without
[T] code changes from upstream. It provides UTF-8 normalization, case
[T] folding and character property functions.

[U] https://download.netsurf-browser.org

[A] Netsurf
[M] andrei32 <andrei32.t2@gmail.com>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS

[L] MIT
